{"id":"c1e64933d6b4128f","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree8 Branch Through Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree — ZFC Tree8 Branch Through Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree — ZFC Tree8 Branch Through Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree — ZFC Tree8 Branch Through Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (tree carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_T\\subseteq T\\times T\\)</span> (tree order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq T\">\\(B\\subseteq T\\)</span> (branch candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(B,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\n\\land\nB\\subseteq T\n\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in B\\;\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall z\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\n(\\exists b\\in B\\;\\langle z,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\to z\\in B\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall b\\in B\\;\n(\\langle t,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\lor\\langle b,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\bigr)\n\\to t\\in B\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(B,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\n\\land\nB\\subseteq T\n\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in B\\;\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall z\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\n(\\exists b\\in B\\;\\langle z,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\to z\\in B\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall b\\in B\\;\n(\\langle t,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\lor\\langle b,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\bigr)\n\\to t\\in B\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The former implication pointed upward and admitted nonbranches. A branch is now a downward-closed chain maximal among chains in the declared tree order.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ (tree-order predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq_T\\subseteq T\\times T","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree8\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8BranchThroughTree}_S(B,T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\preccurlyeq_T)\n\\land\nB\\subseteq T\n\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in B\\;\n(\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\lor\\langle t,s\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall z\\in T\\;\n\\bigl(\n(\\exists b\\in B\\;\\langle z,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\to z\\in B\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\in T\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall b\\in B\\;\n(\\langle t,b\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T\\lor\\langle b,t\\rangle\\in\\preccurlyeq_T)\\bigr)\n\\to t\\in B\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1516,"backlinks":[{"id":"ab547445abec5a1c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9fc846142e98d34","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dda7c85261e49800","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3808","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree8-branch-through-tree]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78"]}